sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Context
    participant O as Outbound WaitableQueue
    participant B as BackgroundThreadImpl
    participant T as ThreadFactory Thread
    participant E as EventLoop
    participant S as Socket
    participant I as Inbound Blocking SPSC Queue
    C->>O: enqueue outbound message
    O-->>T: queue eventfd becomes readable
    T->>E: dispatch queue readiness
    E->>O: drain FIFO messages
    E->>S: write framed bytes
    S-->>E: readable socket bytes
    E->>I: publish verified inbound messages
    I-->>C: blocking dequeue returns
    C->>I: dequeue available messages
